00:28:03.414 --> 00:28:06.369
doing a type, a lot of physical activity to help

00:28:06.369 --> 00:28:08.762
with that. I mean, that, that's got to be connected

00:28:08.762 --> 00:28:11.315
too, right? Speech is just one

00:28:12.231 --> 00:28:15.378
pathway in the brain to get out our language, but

00:28:15.378 --> 00:28:17.658
there's others. So like our kids,

00:28:18.557 --> 00:28:22.588
they can't, they, or can't easily access the speech pathway

00:28:22.588 --> 00:28:26.436
because of their different Trajectory in development, but they can

00:28:26.468 --> 00:28:29.898
