00:30:04.437 --> 00:30:06.874
know, if their, if their vision's messed up. And I

00:30:06.874 --> 00:30:09.635
know, how many times have we seen within the community

00:30:09.635 --> 00:30:10.252
examples

00:30:11.098 --> 00:30:14.116
Of, you know, younger— we're not even younger spellers, but

00:30:14.229 --> 00:30:17.585
new spellers who, you know, gain communication.

00:30:18.404 --> 00:30:21.872
And then like, we, you know, they got glasses, or—

00:30:21.872 --> 00:30:24.328
Yeah, they see all— Everything was like they were seeing

00:30:24.345 --> 00:30:26.898
double. Everything was double vision. Yeah. And they were trying

00:30:26.914 --> 00:30:27.187
to like—

00:30:28.214 --> 00:30:31.233
my, again, my gosh, trying to, trying to function in

