there's 10 skills in a routine.

00:45:16.635 --> 00:45:16.941
And

00:45:17.856 --> 00:45:20.184
yeah, I really enjoy coaching my son and, and my

00:45:20.184 --> 00:45:21.629
clients in that.

00:45:22.975 --> 00:45:25.390
And CrossFit too. Sorry. Sorry. Oh, CrossFit. Oh yeah. I

