one of the highest priorities. So

00:49:38.923 --> 00:49:42.245
at least here, we're We're— we formed this

00:49:43.016 --> 00:49:44.541
organization that hopefully will

00:49:45.360 --> 00:49:49.245
make recommendations for Canada's autism strategy and start to

